# Drafted by Gemini (R16 stonoga), edited.

~ enter
Narrator: Behind the bronze door lies a cramped chamber of flasks, stained parchments, and filthy blades lit by bruise-coloured flames and sour miasma. Over a table bearing a malformed corpse half-fused with a rat-folk traveler, a tall, stringy figure straightens, her neck stretching several feet.
stonoga_blackstinger [smile]: Ooooh, company at the supper hour, tk-tk, step right in! Look at these tender, lively cuts of meat walking right up to my carving board.
-> menu

~ menu
* Talk to her -> chat
* [if flag.skitter_letter_hook or flag.theodora_tell_seen] Mention her eldest sister -> taunt
* Draw steel -> fight
* Back away -> END

~ chat
stonoga_blackstinger [sly]: Silly little Vessla is dead and gone, tk-tk, and after all these long years of waiting, my broth is finally boiling over. Four fresh cuts like you will pack so neatly into my pickling jars.
interject name:delphine_ravelle: Terrible table manners, darling, and your neck is entirely off the bias.
stonoga_blackstinger [smile]: Seventy years ago these miners drank my soup and begged for more, tk-tk, and I have been shaping their sweet marrow ever since.
-> menu

~ taunt
approve delphine_ravelle +3 silas_vane +2: You needled Stonoga with her sister's betrayal
Narrator: You tell her that the postmaster in Wickermoor wants her dead as an offering to the Crooked Queen. Her wet smile vanishes, one dark eye twitches, and her jaw gives a single dry click.
stonoga_blackstinger [angry]: Old Golub always did fancy the biggest portion at the table, tk-tk. I will keep that little thought in mind while I peel the skin from your bones.
set stonoga_taunted
-> fight

~ fight
stonoga_blackstinger [angry]: Hold still now, my sweet, juicy morsels, tk-tk, the first slice is always the wettest!
set stonoga_talked
combat sk_stonoga

~ table
Narrator: On the stained slab lies a malformed corpse half-fused at the ribs with a rat-folk traveler. Folded papers in a torn waistcoat pocket name him Walder Pye, a plagueborn pilgrim from Bubonia who came all this way only to end on a butcher's bench.
set walder_corpse_seen
-> END

~ after
Narrator: Stonoga's black eyes burst like boiled plums and her long neck curls tight as a dying centipede. Her stringy frame melts into grey, stinking sludge while poor Slippery Oswald curls dead in the mire beside her.
interject name:lucan_houndstooth: Appalling manners to the very end, though her venom was a solid seven.
cutscene sk_stonoga_end
cutscene sk_stonoga_end_2
cutscene end
set oswald_slain
set stonoga_after_seen
if flag.skitter_sigils_broken
if not quest.skitter_plague >= exterminated
quest skitter_plague exterminated
endif
set plague_lifted
cutscene sk_plague_lifts
cutscene sk_plague_lifts_2
cutscene end
Narrator: With both the hag and her foul work undone, the heavy miasma thins to nothing. Within the hour, the fever and the crawling plague will lift from Wickermoor Village.
else
Narrator: Though the hag is gone, the knotted sigils in the western chamber still sweat their sour gas. The plague in the village will only end when those last foul marks are broken.
endif
-> END

~ notes
Narrator: {name} lifts a sheaf of damp parchment from the bench, inked in a cramped, wet hand.
stonoga_blackstinger [smile]: Little Vessla is dead, tk-tk, leaving more meat for my pact with dear sister Golub. She sits tucked among the villagers where her beady eyes can watch every soul in town.
give stonoga_notes
set stonoga_notes_read
set golub_clue
Narrator: In the margins, she has scribbled careful studies of Hartsblight forest. When you leave the mine, a tree freed from the plague will grant a waking vision of those fungus-choked woods.
set fate_rejuvenation_found
cutscene sk_rejuvenation
cutscene sk_rejuvenation_2
cutscene end
-> END

~ cage
Narrator: Stacked inside an iron cage are the neatly sorted belongings of someone dear and missing. A grease-stained ledger beside them names the owner an ideal vessel, ready for crookedness, and notes final preparations for "the final nightmare."
cutscene sk_kindred
cutscene sk_kindred_2
cutscene end
set fate_kindred_found
-> END
